# Copy to config/htpasswd (no extension) with real credentials.
# This file protects both the web UI and the chat with HTTP Basic Auth.
#
# Generate a bcrypt entry with:
#     htpasswd -nbB <user> '<password>' >> config/htpasswd
# or without apache2-utils installed:
#     docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -nbB <user> '<password>' >> config/htpasswd
#
# The file must contain only user:hash lines, e.g.:
# alice:$2y$05$Qx0mFbXpaxTMLBjpsJ5F4.q1TzP0lCTWBZdPUCcy1EPBCFdznVKh6
